---
description: MCP and cloud tool use
alwaysApply: true
---
- A connected MCP server is not permission. Context7 read-only documentation lookups are allowed in every task; any other MCP call must be named by the fence.
- Playwright MCP is for local, manual rendered evidence only (IDE). CI runs Playwright as tests, not as MCP.
- Never change DNS, billing, account membership, keys, secrets or repository settings through any tool.
- No marketplace automation or plugin acts on this repository without an OD (see `docs/method/DEVOS_FIT.md` §7a).
